00:17:32,580 --> 00:17:34,620
And contact on, Gorenu.

253
00:17:34,620 --> 00:17:37,440
It's Tezgera. How's it going?

254
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,820
Looks like you were right.

255
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:42,200
Sub and Barra showed up.

256
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,760
Most likely the real ones.

257
00:17:45,420 --> 00:17:49,420
They might be speculating that I'll try to buy cards while they're off playing tag.

258
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:53,940
That means that the ones who are chasing you are Genthru and a couple of fakes.

259
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:56,600
It sounds like your predictions were pretty accurate.

260
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:58,940
That same trick won't work again.

261
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,980
There are four of us and Genthru's all by himself.

262
00:18:02,340 --> 00:18:04,540
If you ask me, now's our chance.

263
00:18:05,220 --> 00:18:06,120
Not yet.

264
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:08,820
I'd prefer much better odds before we fight them.

265
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:10,760
We'll stick to the plan.

266
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:16,320
Here they come. We're back on.

267
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:22,000
Goren.

268
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:23,900
Your time's up.

269
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:25,340
Training's over.

270
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,680
But we still have five days.

271
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:28,920
Had a change in plans.

272
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:31,440
We formed a new strategy to defeat them.

273
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:32,740
Yeah, but...

274
00:18:32,740 --> 00:18:33,400
Hold on!

275
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,520
See, the thing is...

276
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:37,220
I think I'm getting really close.

277
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:38,380
Maybe...

278
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:39,080
Not happening.

279
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:43,300
I can't base our whole strategy on a new technique that isn't reliable yet.

280
00:18:43,980 --> 00:18:44,740
Just give up.

281
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,080
Okay.

282
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:47,800
So the plan is...

283
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:49,120
To use this card.

284
00:18:50,940 --> 00:18:52,800
You'll have to learn it the hard way.

285
00:18:53,460 --> 00:18:54,900
Practice till you've got it perfect.

286
00:18:58,900 --> 00:19:00,380
We're out of accompanies!

287
00:19:00,380 --> 00:19:01,880
Use return!

288
00:19:05,300 --> 00:19:06,580
Return on!

289
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:07,740
To I.I.

290
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:12,360
They're out of accompanies, are they?

291
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:14,500
Endgame's almost upon us.

292
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:16,620
Sub, Bara.

293
00:19:16,840 --> 00:19:18,020
Have you caught anyone?

294
00:19:18,780 --> 00:19:19,920
Yeah, but just one.

295
00:19:20,260 --> 00:19:22,720
And it was a newbie, so he was pretty inexperienced.

296
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:26,480
Word got out that the bombers are hunting players.

297
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:28,180
