305
00:19:51,140 --> 00:19:55,060
If they try to follow us outside the game, we can just hole up at the mansion.

306
00:19:55,560 --> 00:19:58,360
And if they don't follow us, we just have to run out the clock.

307
00:19:58,360 --> 00:20:00,020
